;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Variable usage:
; This is a record of the variables that KFM uses. Keeping a record of your
; variable usage helps you avoid careless mistakes later.
; var(1)  - Used in kfm.cmd for combo condition (updated every tick)
; var(2)  - Used in Kung Fu Throw (state 800) to remember if fwd was being
;           held (remembered from state 800 through state 810).
; var(3)  - Used to check Overdrive' remains active time
; var(4)  - Used to check for Astral Win
; var(5)  - Used to detect P2 movetype
; var(6)  - Used to detect counterhit
; var(7)  - Used to check Active Flow's remains active time
; var(8)  - Used to check if P1 has used Active Flow
; var(9)  - Used to count the remain air jump/air dash
; var(11) - Used to check if P1 can burst
; var(30) - Used to check if P1 is near Glyph 1
; var(31) - Used to check if P1 is near Glyph 2
; var(32) - Used to check if P1 is near Glyph 3
; var(33) - Used to check if P1 is near Glyph 4
; var(34) - Used to check if P1 allowed to cancel Glyph
; var(35) - Used to check if P1 using holding 5D
; var(36) - Used to check Ice Pillar's HP
; var(56)  - Used to check Overdrive cooldown time
; fvar(10) - Used for damage scaling
; fvar(11) - Used for wallbounce

;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Statedef 170]
